  "id": "character-strength",
  "term": "character strength",
  "definition": "Character strength refers to a positive personal trait, such as love of learning, perseverance, or teamwork, that can be measured by self-report and studied in relation to how people function in specific settings. In this research context, different character strengths were linked to differences in achievement and positive learning experiences beyond cognitive ability.",
